      "content": "I'm working on a risk assessment for a warehouse facility in Rotterdam. We have a section on the storage of flammable industrial solvents in high-density racking systems. Can you provide a breakdown of the primary technical risk factors we should consider for the actuarial report, specifically regarding thermal runaway and containment failure?",
